Changed the "Export to file" action on object list views to open a dialog in which the export format, the Export Template, and the fields to export can all be selected, in place of the previous menu of one-click "Export as CSV", "Export as YAML", and per-Export-Template entries.
Changed the "Export to file" action to be disabled, with an explanatory tooltip, for users who cannot run the "Export Object List" Job, or when that Job is disabled.
